title: PeterLunch
---
Peter: "Sniff" I'm so sad!
-> What's wrong? 
    <<jump helpPeterLunch>>
-> Grown man btw. 
    <<stop>>
===
title: helpPeterLunch
---
Peter: I got hacked and have no more swipes! Now I'm gonna starve! 
Peter: Wait a minute... You need chapel credits right?
Peter: If you get me some Cowfila I'll give you one of my credits! Whadda ya say?
-> Fair trade, sure. <<if hasActions()>>
    <<jump peterLunchThanks>>
-> Nah I'm lowkey starving... 
    <<jump peterDisapointed>>

<<stop>>
===
title: peterLunchThanks
---
Peter: Thanks man! Get it to me before the hour ends! 
<<useAction>>
<<stop>>
===
title: peterDisapointed
---
Peter: Dang, whatever man. Good luck getting those credits... 
<<stop>>
===







